I received the following question regarding parcel 153775 (1621 Clermont Rd=
 Durham, NC 27713) :
               Q : "Are there back taxes, tax liens, or special assessments=
 on the parcel?"

This parcel does not owe any back taxes, the tax office has no liens on the=
 property, and there are no special assessments on this parcel.

Please let me know if you have any further questions regarding the taxing/b=
ills of this property.


Warm regards,

EMMA PELFREY | REVENUE AGENT
